Use cWebView.pkg
Use cWebGroup.pkg
Use cWebHtmlBox.pkg

Use SelectLiga.wo
Use SelectEquipo.wo
Use SelectEntrenador.wo
Use SelectJugador.wo
Use SelectPosicion.wo

Object oDashboard is a cWebView
    Set psCaption to "FutbolWebApp"
    Set piColumnCount to 12

    Object oTiles_grp is a cWebGroup
        Set pbShowBorder to False
        Set piColumnCount to 12
        Set psCSSClass to "TilesGroup"

        Object oTileLiga is a cWebHtmlBox
            Set piColumnSpan to 4
            Set psCSSClass to "Tile"
            Set pbServerOnClick to True
            Set psHtml to '<div class="Tile_BigLabel" data-ServerOnClick="tile" data-OnClickParam="liga">Ligas</div><div class="Tile_SmallLabel">Competiciones</div>'

            Procedure OnClick String sId String sParam
                Send NavigateForward of oSelectLiga Self
            End_Procedure
        End_Object

        Object oTileEquipo is a cWebHtmlBox
            Set piColumnSpan to 4
            Set piColumnIndex to 4
            Set psCSSClass to "Tile DarkAlternate"
            Set pbServerOnClick to True
            Set psHtml to '<div class="Tile_BigLabel" data-ServerOnClick="tile" data-OnClickParam="equipo">Equipos</div><div class="Tile_SmallLabel">Clubes por liga</div>'

            Procedure OnClick String sId String sParam
                Send NavigateForward of oSelectEquipo Self
            End_Procedure
        End_Object

        Object oTileEntrenador is a cWebHtmlBox
            Set piColumnSpan to 4
            Set piColumnIndex to 8
            Set psCSSClass to "Tile Dark"
            Set pbServerOnClick to True
            Set psHtml to '<div class="Tile_BigLabel" data-ServerOnClick="tile" data-OnClickParam="entrenador">Entrenadores</div><div class="Tile_SmallLabel">Cuerpo técnico</div>'

            Procedure OnClick String sId String sParam
                Send NavigateForward of oSelectEntrenador Self
            End_Procedure
        End_Object

        Object oTileJugador is a cWebHtmlBox
            Set piColumnSpan to 6
            Set psCSSClass to "Tile LightAlternate"
            Set pbServerOnClick to True
            Set psHtml to '<div class="Tile_BigLabel" data-ServerOnClick="tile" data-OnClickParam="jugador">Jugadores</div><div class="Tile_SmallLabel">Plantillas</div>'

            Procedure OnClick String sId String sParam
                Send NavigateForward of oSelectJugador Self
            End_Procedure
        End_Object

        Object oTilePosicion is a cWebHtmlBox
            Set piColumnSpan to 6
            Set piColumnIndex to 6
            Set psCSSClass to "Tile"
            Set pbServerOnClick to True
            Set psHtml to '<div class="Tile_BigLabel" data-ServerOnClick="tile" data-OnClickParam="posicion">Posiciones</div><div class="Tile_SmallLabel">Portero, defensa…</div>'

            Procedure OnClick String sId String sParam
                Send NavigateForward of oSelectPosicion Self
            End_Procedure
        End_Object

    End_Object

    WebRegisterPath ntNavigateForward oSelectLiga
    WebRegisterPath ntNavigateForward oSelectEquipo
    WebRegisterPath ntNavigateForward oSelectEntrenador
    WebRegisterPath ntNavigateForward oSelectJugador
    WebRegisterPath ntNavigateForward oSelectPosicion
End_Object
